      "content": "It sounds understandably unnerving to experience flickering lights in a patterned way, especially when it coincides with private conversations. While some electronics can have weird behavior, this specific rhythm correlating with conversations is unusual and points toward a potential interference or software issue rather than known eavesdropping capabilities. Before assuming a malicious signal, you might try power cycling your smart hubs and checking for firmware updates as a troubleshooting step.",
